  description="Capabilities hold non-UI domain rules (pricing, eligibility, codecs, scorers, gates). Hosts do UI and I/O. Utility helpers teach the pipeline — they are not the ceiling."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/where-does-business-logic-live-in-traverse.html"
